<%- include('_policy-head') %>
<section class="section"><div class="container-x max-w-3xl prose-ek">
  <h2>Using this website</h2>
  <p>By using this website, placing an order or making a booking you agree to these terms. Prices are in Nepali Rupees (NPR) and include applicable taxes unless stated otherwise.</p>
  <h2>Orders and delivery</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Orders are confirmed by phone before dispatch. We may cancel an order if an item is unavailable or a price was shown in error, with a full refund of any payment.</li>
    <li>Delivery charges depend on your area (inside Ring Road, rest of the Kathmandu Valley, or outside the valley by weight) and are shown at checkout.</li>
    <li>Cash on delivery orders must be paid in full to the rider. Online orders not paid within 30 minutes are cancelled automatically.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Bookings</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>House calls are available inside the Kathmandu Valley (Kathmandu, Lalitpur and Bhaktapur).</li>
    <li>You can reschedule or cancel online until 12 hours before your appointment. After that, please call us.</li>
    <li>Services that require an advance (for example mating and boarding) are cancelled automatically if the advance is not paid within 30 minutes of booking.</li>
    <li>Treatment and vaccination are performed by or under the supervision of a registered veterinarian.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Pets for sale</h2>
  <p>The sale of animals is covered by our <a href="/animal-sale-policy">Animal Sale and Health Guarantee Policy</a>. A deposit reserves a pet for 72 hours.</p>
  <h2>Liability</h2>
  <p>We take great care with every animal in our custody. Our liability for any service is limited to the amount paid for that service, except where the law says otherwise.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p><%= business.name %>, <%= business.address %>. Phone <a href="<%= telLink() %>"><%= business.landlineDisplay %></a>.</p>
</div></section>
